  {"id":145,"x":580,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Old Oak Tree, Amongst the Branches","descriptions":["Boughs hung heavy with leaves tenderly enfold the old oak tree, much like a protective glove that is designed to provide a safe haven for the hands.  High overhead, a large branch leads further up into the tree for a better view of the countryside."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"climb","move":"climb gap"},{"to":146,"exit":"climb","move":"climb shallow knothole"},{"to":147,"exit":"climb","move":"climb large branch"}]},
  {"id":146,"x":600,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Old Oak Tree, Amongst the Branches","descriptions":["Thick and twisted, one heavily gnarled limb reaches out like a claw, softened only slightly by the tangled vines of deep green ivy curling leisurely along it.  Perched uneasily in a slight groove between two branches lie the withered remnants of a tiny nest, long abandoned by its owner."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"climb","move":"climb shallow knothole"},{"to":148,"exit":"climb","move":"climb limb"}]},
  {"id":147,"x":580,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Old Oak Tree, Amongst the Branches","descriptions":["A thick latticework of leaves forms a dense, canopied bough overhead, just within arm's reach.  Rough black bark scrubs mercilessly at the hands, in stark contrast to the soft foliage it gives birth to.  Several limbs gently divide off to form cozy forks in which to sit and relax from the labors of the hunt or while planning the next adventure."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"climb","move":"climb large branch"},{"to":148,"exit":"climb","move":"climb bough"}]},
  {"id":148,"x":580,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Old Oak Tree, The Treetop","descriptions":["Balancing precariously on two gnarled branches that sway underfoot allows for a spectacular view of the surrounding wilderness from the thick crown leaves.  Carved into the rough, black bark of the swiftly aging oak are a series of carefully chiseled letters."],"exits":[{"to":146,"exit":"climb","move":"climb limb"},{"to":147,"exit":"climb","move":"climb bough"}]},
  {"id":149,"x":280,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["Grey bushes bristling with hundreds of small, pointed thorns stand like giant sentries at silent attention in this tunnel, ready to strike at the first sign of invasion."],"exits":[{"to":150,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":160,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"}]},
  {"id":150,"x":300,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["Thorny brambles engulf everything in sight, forming both rug and canopy.  Through the laticework of grey branches you can dimly make out lights winking their message of cheer and warmth from distant cities.","Thorny brambles engulf everything in sight, forming both rug and canopy.  Through the latticework of grey branches you can dimly make out lights winking their message of cheer and warmth from distant cities."],"exits":[{"to":151,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":149,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":151,"x":320,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["A bristling net of thorns covers the stump of a silverwood sapling.  The remaining bark gleams in all its primal glory, but dried black stains on the thorns testify that travelers have tried to remove a few souvenir splinters from the stump in the past."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":150,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":152,"x":340,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["A few variwinkles peek out from the wild tangle of surrounding thorn bushes.  Their small purple flowers nod among the briars, dancing innocently in the fitful play of light."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":151,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":153,"x":340,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["Tendrils of snakeweed wind endlessly through mounds of dagger-thorn bushes like the work of some sylvan weaver.  The result is a clogged thicket of grey branches striped bright green, shimmering in the air as it stirs with every passing breeze."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":154,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":154,"x":340,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["The thorn thicket crests like a giant grey wave, engulfing several dead black oaks.  Wisps of nests can still be seen in their higher boughs."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":155,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":155,"x":320,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["A dark green moss expands along every curve of the sloping hills of this region.  The moss in turn is completely covered by a patchwork blanket of brush, its thorns glistening with dew."],"exits":[{"to":154,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":156,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":156,"x":300,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["Several caves open into the side of a enormous, moss-covered mound.  They were once occupied by intelligent creatures, judging by the rusty tools which lie scattered about their entrances.  However, an impenetrable wall of bramble now prevents any access."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":157,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":157,"x":280,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket, Deep","descriptions":["A small metal cart lies on its side, its wheels broken, its spilled contents a rotted, unidentifiable mass.  Spread over its surface is a heavy layer of brambles speckled with vivid red thornberries."],"exits":[{"to":158,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":156,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":158,"x":300,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket","descriptions":["A small animal thrashes about in the all-encompassing vegetation, trapped, reduced to anonymous pulp by the action of innumerable thorns.  The bushes that hold it seem almost alive, their scraggly branches clinging with single-minded frenzy."],"exits":[{"to":157,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":159,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":159,"x":280,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket","descriptions":["A horde of dense brambles crowds in upon this area from all sides, and from above.  Gusts of wind send its nettled branches snicking loudly with sinister emphasis. "],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":158,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":160,"x":300,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Thorn Thicket","descriptions":["Ravens tap and pick at the engulfing net of thistle branches weaving across several defoliated oak trees.  They carefully avoid the sharp thorns, but blackened blotches underfoot reveal their occasional lack of past success."],"exits":[{"to":159,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":149,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":161,"x":360,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Northern Trade Road, Wooded Valley","descriptions":["You come upon a small clearing in the heavy woods that allows a view of the sky.  A faint path can be made out that wanders into the trees, but it fades off before you can wonder about where it might lead.  There is an unnerving quiet here, even the wind seems to have died.  You feel a stranger in this wild place, perhaps an unwelcome stranger."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":162,"x":500,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Northern Trade Road, Wooded Valley","descriptions":["You come upon a small clearing in the heavy woods that allows a view of the sky.  A faint path can be made out that wanders into the trees, but it fades off before you can wonder about where it might lead.  There is an unnerving quiet here, even the wind seems to have died.  You feel a stranger in this wild place, perhaps an unwelcome stranger."],"exits":[]}
 ],
